    "id" : 19,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 188.72, 775.995, 336.081, 843.634 ],
    "font" : "Arial Unicode MS",
    "font size" : 9.92,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "My first impression of New York was that people's living standard was exclusively on a high level materially, comparing to Japanese. I was surprised to see the babies fat like pigs. But Hometimes I thought this huge stone-city look-"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
