    "bounding box" : [ 41.72, 773.995, 183.567, 841.567 ],
    "font" : "Arial Unicode MS",
    "font size" : 10.77,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "I wanted to call my father \"Oyaji\" and mother \"Okan,\" as you know these words are spoken in themountain village where I was evacuated during the war. These words have a characteristic of fanner's affection without any un-"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
