    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "they were insulting me. I sticked on one of them unconsciouslyuntil I bust him up. Fortunately the rest of them disappeared in the crowds. When I wes looking, with a bloody nose and a bruised cheek, for my books I left on the street, I found a Chinesefriendwhocouldn't speak English better than me was holding my books with a great care. Within a year I wanted to get out of this joint and study in a decentschool with decentfriends."
