    "font" : "Arial Unicode MS",
    "font size" : 9.64,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The food from all overthe world werepiled up in the stores. As I had a hell of a lot of \"Oh Henry\" on the boattill I contented, I used to feel to vomit whenever I saw them. Also my parents told me to eat this and that, as a result I got indigestion."
  }, {
